msgid "Page with the [eu2673_withdrawal_form] shortcode. Customers who bought without an account withdraw here with their order number and email."
msgstr "Pagina met de shortcode [eu2673_withdrawal_form]. Klanten die zonder account hebben gekocht, herroepen hier met hun bestelnummer en e-mailadres."

msgid "Links to the withdrawal page"
msgstr "Links naar de herroepingspagina"

msgid "Show a link at the bottom of every page"
msgstr "Een link onderaan elke pagina tonen"

msgid "Add a link to the WooCommerce order emails sent to the customer"
msgstr "Een link toevoegen aan de bestelmails van WooCommerce aan de klant"

msgid "The withdrawal function must be prominently displayed and available throughout the withdrawal period (Art. 11a(1))."
msgstr "De herroepingsfunctie moet duidelijk zichtbaar en gedurende de hele herroepingstermijn beschikbaar zijn (art. 11 bis, lid 1)."

msgid "Order received page"
msgstr "Pagina Bestelling ontvangen"

